{"id":"wb-7-1330","name":"长青春科尔寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"长青春科尔寺","text":"长青春科尔寺（藏语：བྱམས་ཆེན་ཆོས་སྐོར་གླིང་།，威利转写：byams chen chos skor gling，藏语拼音：Qamqên Qögor Ling），亦称理塘寺（藏语：ལི་ཐང་དགོན་པ་།，威利转写：li thang dogn pa），位于四川甘孜藏族自治州理塘县，是康巴第一大格鲁派寺院，曾有称曰：“上有拉萨三大寺，下有安多塔尔寺，中有理塘长青春科尔寺”。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%95%BF%E9%9D%92%E6%98%A5%E7%A7%91%E5%B0%94%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":95385035,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95385035","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/b102c19b86f3effe3de18149.jpg","title":"理塘长青春科尔寺.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%90%86%E5%A1%98%E9%95%BF%E9%9D%92%E6%98%A5%E7%A7%91%E5%B0%94%E5%AF%BA.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bb/%E7%90%86%E5%A1%98%E9%95%BF%E9%9D%92%E6%98%A5%E7%A7%91%E5%B0%94%E5%AF%BA.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Wang Junbo (留言 · 贡献)","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"","caption":"​理塘长青春科尔寺","width":320,"height":240,"matchEvidence":"对应 Wikidata 条目的 P18 配图"}}